 27t17 50 35z referenc by codeboten\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874bc7c88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"id\": \"d8242cafdf66d46e\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2565068418384736, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.06665555834067659, \"vector_similarity\": 0.69949317, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874bc7c88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2849, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:14\", \"token_count\": 1120, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-07]\\n\\n# Pull Request: otelgin: remove unneeded context save/restore to avoid data race (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib#8014)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/pull/8014  \\n\\n**Author**: nicksherron  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-14T04:01:24Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-17T10:42:07Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: closed  \\n\\n**Branch**: `fix/otelgin-data-race` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +83 / -10 across 2 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: —\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Users Cannot Fix This Themselves\\n\\n This is middleware code that users cannot work around without forking the library. The race happens inside otelgin.Middleware(). A user who wants to use otelgin AND pass race detection has no choice but to:\\n\\n  1. Fork this library\\n\\n  2. Apply this exact fix\\n\\n  3. Maintain their fork indefinitely\\n\\n  This is not \\\"leaving the decision to users\\\"—it's forcing users to fork or live with failing race detection.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-07]\\n\\n# Pull Request: otelgin: remove unneeded context save/restore to avoid data race (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib#8014)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/pull/8014  \\n\\n**Author**: nicksherron  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-14T04:01:24Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-17T10:42:07Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: closed  \\n\\n**Branch**: `fix/otelgin-data-race` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +83 / -10 across 2 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: —\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Precedent: This Project Has Fixed Similar Races Before\\n\\n  From the git history:\\n\\n  - #4577: \\\"otelgrpc: Fix data race in stats handlers\\\" (merged)\\n\\n  - #881: \\\"otelsarama: Fix WrapAsyncProducer race condition\\\" (merged)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src pr 07 pull request otelgin remov unneed context save restor to avoid data race open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 8014 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8014 author nicksherron creat 2025 10 14t04 01 24z updat 2025 10 17t10 42 07z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close branch fix otelgin data race main chang 83 10 across 2 file label mileston user can not fix this themselv this is middlewar code that user can not work around without fork the librari the race happen insid otelgin middlewar a user who want to use otelgin and pas race detect ha no choic but to 1 fork this librari 2 appli this exact fix 3 maintain their fork indefinit this is not leav the decis to user it s forc user to fork or live with fail race detect sourc id src pr 07 pull request otelgin remov unneed context save restor to avoid data race open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 8014 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8014 author nicksherron creat 2025 10 14t04 01 24z updat 2025 10 17t10 42 07z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close branch fix otelgin data race main chang 83 10 across 2 file label mileston preced this project ha fix similar race befor from the git histori 4577 otelgrpc fix data race in stat handler merg 881 otelsarama fix wrapasyncproduc race condit merg\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8753acb88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"id\": \"c020b4557f49eb79\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2562402121057609, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07498750300822993, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6791632, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8753acb88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 33019, \"chunk_count\": 21, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:16\", \"token_count\": 10517, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-04]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Use sync.Map and atomics to improve sum performance (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7427)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7427  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-09-29T14:36:56Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-14T14:40:27Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-10-07T13:40:23Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_counter_syncmap` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +437 / -121 across 14 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: area:metrics  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.39.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Review Comments (18)\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `CHANGELOG.md` — 2025-10-02T17:55:27Z\\n\\n```suggestion\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n```\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `sdk/metric/internal/aggregate/aggregate.go` — 2025-10-03T00:03:10Z\\n\\nPassing the temporality only to then parse it below and make a decision here seems like a bad smell. I'm more inclined to refactoring the Sum in some way to better address this and remove the control param being passed here.\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `sdk/metric/internal/aggregate/sum.go` — 2025-10-03T15:10:13Z\\n\\nA pre-increment approach with rollback may address this.\\n\\n```suggestion\\n\\n\\t\\t// Pre-increment, reserve a slot first.\\n\\n\\t\\tnewLen := s.len[hotIdx].Add(1)\\n\\n\\t\\tif s.aggLimit > 0 && newLen >= int64(s.aggLimit) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t// We exceeded the limit, decrement back and use overflow\\n\\n\\t\\t\\ts.len[hotIdx].Add(-1)\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tfltrAttr = overflowSet\\n\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\n```\\n\\n**MrAlias** on `sdk/metric/internal/aggregate/sum.go` — 2025-10-03T15:14:24Z\\n\\nSplitting this into a type dedicated to cumulative values seems appropriate. It would have fields like this right?\\n\\n```suggestion\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src pr 04 pull request use sync map and atom to improv sum perform open telemetri opentelemetri go 7427 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7427 author dashpol creat 2025 09 29t14 36 56z updat 2025 10 14t14 40 27z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 10 07t13 40 23z branch optim _ counter _ syncmap main chang 437 121 across 14 file label area metric mileston v1 39 0 review comment 18 mralia on changelog md 2025 10 02t17 55 27z suggest improv perform of concurr measur in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7427 mralia on sdk metric intern aggreg aggreg go 2025 10 03t00 03 10z pass the tempor onli to then pars it below and make a decis here seem like a bad smell i m more inclin to refactor the sum in some way to better address this and remov the control param be pass here mralia on sdk metric intern aggreg sum go 2025 10 03t15 10 13z a pre increment approach with rollback may address this suggest pre increment reserv a slot first newlen s len hotidx add 1 if s agglimit 0 newlen int64 s agglimit we exceed the limit decrement back and use overflow s len hotidx add 1 fltrattr overflowset mralia on sdk metric intern aggreg sum go 2025 10 03t15 14 24z split this into a type dedic to cumul valu seem appropri it would have field like this right suggest\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"875c049e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"id\": \"4b83ef940640c267\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2552204246403356, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.09165139234333658, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6368815, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"875c049e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7427.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 37741, \"chunk_count\": 26, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:02\", \"token_count\": 14705, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-02]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Project Proposal: Ecosystem Explorer (open-telemetry/community#3000)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/community/pull/3000  \\n\\n**Author**: jaydeluca  \