ss 2 file label mileston this pr fix an exist bug not introduc new safeti mechan i respect disagre with the character that this pr introduc mechan for concurr safeti the opposit is true this pr remov problemat code that caus a data race the current code ha a real reproduc race condit report in issu 4588 open for 2 year the race detector fail consist this is not theoret it violat go s memori model sourc id src pr 07 pull request otelgin remov unneed context save restor to avoid data race open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 8014 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8014 author nicksherron creat 2025 10 14t04 01 24z updat 2025 10 17t10 42 07z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close branch fix otelgin data race main chang 83 10 across 2 file\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8753acb88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"id\": \"79dd2c776e5b2e7f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33378602362338555, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.14320685517626508, \"vector_similarity\": 0.77847075, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8753acb88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 33019, \"chunk_count\": 21, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:16\", \"token_count\": 10517, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"  - Seek more engagement from gRPC; attempt in-person conversations at KubeCon if possible. David will sync with Josh on outreach.\\n\\n- Conclusion: Not likely to stabilize this year; set a goal to finalize a strategy next year once semconv progress is clearer.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n- [Stabilization of otelgrpc](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/8078)?\\n\\n  - Related: [https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8265](https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8265)  \\n\\n  - We need the semconv to stabilize  \\n\\n  - There needs to be involvement from gRPC to progress this  \\n\\n  - [David] Update: I’m told that the SIG is active and is working towards stabilization. Not sure if gRPC is involved.  \\n\\n### Stabilization of otelhttp\\n\\n- Damien proposed starting an API audit for otelhttp to move towards stabilization.\\n\\n- A known bug (issue #7254) may be the only blocker; it’s a behavioral change around how errors are marked (events vs attributes) and interacts with semconv/spec wording.\\n\\n- Agreement:\\n\\n  - Begin the API review.\\n\\n  - Robert will take ownership of #7254 and draft a document clarifying interpretation and proposed resolution.\\n\\n  - The existence of bugs does not inherently block stabilization; they can be fixed post-stabilization if changes are non-breaking or properly versioned.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n- Blocker (only one I think): [https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254)  \\n\\n### OTel Explorer Go docs\\n\\n- Mike outlined a project to revamp the OTEL registry/explorer with a schema that documents spans/metrics emitted by instrumentations, aiming to render via Hugo and enable static analysis across Go SDKs and contrib modules.\\n\\n- Tyler’s feedback:\\n\\n  - Strong requirement: align schema with semantic conventions and ensure it’s compatible with Weaver (to enable validation and transformations across versions).\\n\\n  - Consider providing a JSON Schema (or CUE) for validation and potentially linking to existing semconv definitions to keep the spec concise.\\n\\n  - Scope can include eBPF/auto-instrumentation; representation should still fit the schema as long as it maps to OTEL signals.\\n\\n- Mike will iterate on the schema, explore Weaver integration, and coordinate with SIGs as needed.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n  - Context: [https://github.com/open-telemetry/community/pull/3000](https://github.com/open-telemetry/community/pull/3000)  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"seek more engag from grpc attempt in person convers at kubecon if possibl david will sync with josh on outreach conclus not like to stabil this year set a goal to final a strategi next year onc semconv progress is clearer refer stabil of otelgrpc http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 8078 relat http github com grpc grpc go issu 8265 http github com grpc grpc go issu 8265 we need the semconv to stabil there need to be involv from grpc to progress this david updat i m told that the sig is activ and is work toward stabil not sure if grpc is involv stabil of otelhttp damien propos start an api audit for otelhttp to move toward stabil a known bug issu 7254 may be the onli blocker it s a behavior chang around how error are mark event v attribut and interact with semconv spec word agreement begin the api review robert will take ownership of 7254 and draft a document clarifi interpret and propos resolut the exist of bug doe not inher block stabil they can be fix post stabil if chang are non break or proper version refer blocker onli one i think http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 otel explor go doc mike outlin a project to revamp the otel registri explor with a schema that document span metric emit by instrument aim to render via hugo and enabl static analysi across go sdks and contrib modul tyler s feedback strong requir align schema with semant convent and ensur it s compat with weaver to enabl valid and transform across version consid provid a json schema or cue for valid and potenti link to exist semconv definit to keep the spec concis scope can includ ebpf auto instrument represent should still fit the schema a long a it map to otel signal mike will iter on the schema explor weaver integr and coordin with sig a need refer context http github com open telemetri communiti pull 3000 http github com open telemetri communiti pull 3000\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874039c68a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"id\": \"5449cc5184194ce6\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33049584862338555, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.14320685517626508, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7675035, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874039c68a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 7597, \"chunk_count\": 4, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:24\", \"token_count\": 1926, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"After discussing it at the 23-OCT SIG call, the decision is in the short term to include this in an `init` function in the otelconf package that will automatically configure the SDK components\\n\\n---\\n\\n**dashpole** — 2025-12-04T18:32:17Z\\n\\n> in the short term to include this in an init function in the otelconf package\\n\\nOut of curiosity, what is the long-term plan?\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-ISSUE-05]\\n\\n# Issue: otelconf: add support for OTEL_EXPE