s).\\n\\n  - Create a smaller PR to allow disabling runtime tracer integration.\\n\\n  - Explore flaky test issues in `contrib`.\\n\\n- [ ] Maintainers:\\n\\n  - Provide onboarding support (buddy/help via Slack) for new contributors.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"date 2025 11 27 decis do not merg larg public api chang without prior issu discuss proceed increment start with a small chang e g abil to disabl runtim tracer integr open an issu to document the profil propos befor continu api chang keep current larg pr a draft proof of concept sourc id src note 08 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2026 02 27 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3974113940 author pellar creat 2026 02 27t17 20 46z updat 2026 02 27t17 21 05z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 27 action item nico hertz open an issu describ the runtim profil problem and propos mode semant trade off creat a smaller pr to allow disabl runtim tracer integr explor flaki test issu in contrib maintain provid onboard support buddi help via slack for new contributor\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8738b66a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"id\": \"9b5b6f01e95cbce3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31193858816099657, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.14465258308713794, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7022726, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8738b66a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3929, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:30\", \"